","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"UoZg0xZepdMXbK_2dtT2nw","review_id":"L9bcl84nEpHbE6GVmpbLOQ","date":"2017-02-12T15:33:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9435780048370361,"text_excerpt":"So happy that Gracious Bakery is now in The Garden District. Judging from the business this morning, it's going to be a very good fit for the neighborhood. I ordered the Oliver for breakfast, which features softly scrambled eggs on their green onion bread, which is ciabatta~like, topped with melted smoked cheddar, aioli and arugula. This is a delicious sandwich, with the garlic in the aioli being just assertive enough, and with truly buttery textured scrambled eggs. I had a couple of bites of my partner's chocolate croissant, and found that delicious too. I've sampled the absinthe truffles...an unusual flavor combo that's not to be missed. My coffee was tasty but not hot enough, and one o..."},{"business_id":"UoZg0xZepdMXbK_2dtT2nw","review_id":"sGVvMMZ58KtTFFTBxnqE5w","date":"2018-07-14T21:20:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9409862756729126,"text_excerpt":"I usually just stop in here on my way to work and get a almond croissant. THEY ARE AMAZINGGGGGG!!!! But today I was really hungry at lunch and Uber eats was looking too expensive so I decided to walk from my job to gracious cafe (about 7mins) and I'd honestly do it again. I got the roasted tomato caprese sandwich and it was so delicious. Everything tasted fresh but flavorful. The only thing I would do different is ask to have it warmed. I did not realize it would be served cold. I'm also a lavender lover and they had a blueberry lavender cupcake. It was ok. Kinda dry and the flavoring was decent. But overall I will be back for lunch! The service was also very nice and welcoming. The insid..."},{"business_id":"UoZg0xZepdMXbK_2dtT2nw","review_id":"OVcc5244y0MWN1HqlabY4g","date":"2018-01-11T19:12:13","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9380701780319214,"text_excerpt":"Came here to grab a quick to go lunch yesterday since I've been following them on Instagram for a while and have been wanting to stop by. I was so tempted to try their baked goods but decided to be healthy and get their greek salad with barley and a small iced latte instead. Everything was so yummy! The latte was perfect-one of the best I've tried in the area. The Greek salad was also amazing. I've never had barley in a Greek salad before but I actually really liked it as it gave the salad more depth. And I can't forget to mention the dressing which was phenomenal. I really liked this spot because it was cozy and everything looked fresh. The employees are also some of the friendliest I've..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"UoZg0xZepdMXbK_2dtT2nw","photo_id":"6zrwkZp6o_KvRa17aygaKg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/6zrwkZp6o_KvRa17aygaKg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8908251523971558},{"business_id":"UoZg0xZepdMXbK_2dtT2nw","photo_id":"hUkD_UCDeETP3bYtD8dnyQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/hUkD_UCDeETP3bYtD8dnyQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.87460970